<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15415" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅρπαξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰγος</span>, ὁ, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁρπάζω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>robbing, rapacious,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				137
			</span></i>, v.l. in<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				628
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				3.1.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύκοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					1309
				</span></i>
			 (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄτρακας</span>
			): also c. Subst. neut., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅρπαγι χείλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.272
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Bianor</span>): 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁρπαγίστατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.Com.
					57
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> mostly as
				Subst., </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅρπαξ, ἡ,</span>
			<i>rapine,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				356
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅρπαξ, ὁ,</span>
			<i>robber, peculator,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν δημοσίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					351
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ μὲν κλέπτης ὁ δ᾽ ἅ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Myrtil.
					4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντες εἰσὶν ἅρπαγες</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ Ὠρώπιοι</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Xeno
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> species of
				<i>wolf,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				3.304
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>grappling-iron,</i> used in sea-fights, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				5.118
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Moschio
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				5.208d
			</span></i>; <i>flesh-hook,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				8.3.7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
